        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GDP150024FBR, Guadalupe Offset Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 Inch Guadalupe Pull features a 1-1/2 inch solid brass bamboo styled grip and offset beveled mounts. This beautiful door pull is very versatile as it can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This means that it is way more than just a door pull. Use it as an appliance handle, a shower door pull, or even on a dresser. It is available in many different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP04-specifciations.gif?v=1704354718\" width=\"554\" height=\"293\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions GDP150024FBR Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions GDP150024FBR Guadalupe Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.68\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP04-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262328\"><b>First Impressions GDP150024FBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Guadalupe Pull",
                "description": "The 24 Inch Guadalupe Pull features a 1-1/2 inch solid brass bamboo styled grip and offset beveled mounts. This beautiful door pull is very versatile as it can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. This means that it is way more than just a door pull. Use it as an appliance handle, a shower door pull, or even on a dresser. It is available in many different finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "FII-GDP04024, 24 Inch Guadalupe Pulls, First Impressions GDP04024, Guadalupe Collection Series 4 Door Pulls, bamboo door pulls, bamboo handles, Offset Guadalupe door pulls, offset bamboo pulls, First Impressions GDP04024 Guadalupe Handles, FII-GDP150024FBR, First Impressions GDP150024FBR, Guadalupe Collection 150 Door Pulls"
